{"step_index":7011,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T14:12:55Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. Well real time syncing possible?\n2. Well drivr api dileo ami onpy ekta folder er access dite chai,,,,,How?\n3. Full steps dao\n4. Viewer upload kirte parbe ki naa? Search official doc,,,,no edit or delete permission\n5. name: >-\n  projects/irak-mahmud-project/constraints/iam.managed.disableServiceAccountApiKeyCreation\nresource_types: iam.googleapis.com/ServiceAccountApiKeyBinding\nmethod_types:\n  - CREATE\n  - UPDATE\ncondition: >-\n  !(size(resource.targets) > 0 && resource.targets.all(target, target.service in\n  parameters.allowedServices))\naction_type: DENY\ndisplay_name: Block service account API key bindings\ndescription: >-\n  When enforced, disables creation of API Keys bound to service accounts, unless\n  the API Key's API targets are non-empty and exclusively limited to the\n  allowedServices.\nparameters:\n  - key: allowedServices\n    value:\n      type: LIST\n      defaultValue:\n        - generativelanguage.googleapis.com\n      metadata:\n        description: The list of allowed services for API Keys bound to service accounts.\n6. Setai hosse naa,,,auth client kivabe korbo\n7. [ফাইল ইনপুট: /home/azureuser/.webterminal/media/media_1790345180925_client_secret_REDACTED_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.redacted__1_.json]. মূল ফাইলের নাম: \"client_secret_REDACTED_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.redacted (1).json\". অনুগ্রহ করে view_file(\"/home/azureuser/.webterminal/media/media_1790345180925_client_secret_REDACTED_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.redacted__1_.json\") ব্যবহার করে ফাইলটি পর্যবেক্ষণ করুন এবং বিস্তারিত সঠিক উত্তর দিন।\n8. Ei id er ki ki access thakbe?\n9. Kono sync ekhoni start hobe naa...,tasara eita to full drive er access nebe mone hoy\n10. Are vai, Google drive er ekta folder er access problem solve korte bolsi parso naa?\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **Immediate User Goal:** Restrict Google Drive backup access strictly to a **single, isolated folder** with zero access to the user's personal files, photos, or existing documents. No sync must start autonomously until explicitly confirmed.\n- **Context & Mission:**\n  - Guide \"ইরাক ভাইয়া\" through authenticating Google Drive safely without granting full drive permissions.\n  - Resolve the technical conflict where standard Google Drive permissions require \"Editor\" to upload, by applying:\n    1. **OAuth Scope `drive.file`:** Restricts the app to *only* see and manage files created by the backup app itself; existing drive contents remain 100% invisible.\n    2. **Rclone `root_folder_id`:** Locks the remote directory root to a single Google Drive folder ID, making everything outside that folder non-existent to the application.\n  - Maintain the active multi-cloud bridge between Azure VM (`FatehAli`) and Google Cloud VM (`instance-20260925-131309`).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Google Drive OAuth Client Setup:**\n  - Client secret JSON successfully parsed and validated from:\n    [`file:///home/azureuser/.config/rclone/client_secret.json`](file:///home/azureuser/.config/rclone/client_secret.json)\n    - Client ID: `REDACTED_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.redacted`\n    - Client Secret: `[REDACTED_SECRET]`\n    - Project: `irak-mahmud-project`\n  - Active background Rclone authorization listener started with scope `drive.file`:\n    Task ID: `47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/task-7010`\n- **Google Cloud VM Live Connection (Verified & Active):**\n  - Host: `35.253.244.80` (us-central1-a)\n  - User: `azureuser-to-google-vm`\n  - Authentication: Ed25519 SSH Key (`~/.ssh/id_ed25519`), passwordless SSH, `SUDO: OK`.\n  - Discovered full pre-migration project tree preserved intact in `/home/mdkamruzzamanirak_gmail_com`:\n    - `Frappe-erp-Alco/`, `frappe_db_backup.sql` (9.2 MB)\n    - `Rust_Task_With_Time_Keeping_And_Live_Note/`, `Article-Publishing-Platform/`\n    - `telegram-bot/`, `kids_tube_with_folder_seection/`, `openrecall_vault/`\n    - `payload_articles.sql`, `ANTIGRAVITY_COMPLETE_SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md`, `GEMINI.md`\n- **Azure Disk & Swap Optimization:**\n  - 40 GB swapfile (`/home/swapfile`) deactivated, removed from `/etc/fstab`, and deleted.\n  - `/home` partition (`/dev/nvme1n1`, 220 GB) now has **199 GB free (97% free)**; only 6.1 GB used.\n- **YouTube Pipeline Ground Truth:**\n  - `output_packaged`: **217 playable MP4 packages**, all with 100% complete `prompt_info.json` and `youtube_metadata.json` (868 JSON files, 0 errors).\n  - `RESTORED_VIDEOS`: 136 files, of which **23 are distinct unique MP4s**, bringing total physical recovered MP4s to **240**.\n  - SQLite DB: 7,660 prompts (10 levels × 766), 555 SEO metadata records, 325 completed video entries.\n- **Forensic Post-Mortem of Previous Deletion:**\n  - Accidental deletion was caused by a bash double-quote command substitution trap:\n    `python3 -c \"text = '''... (`find -delete` ...) ...'''\"`\n    Bash evaluated `` `find -delete` `` inside `\"...\"` as command substitution and ran `find . -delete` in `/home/azureuser`. Process was killed immediately, and data was recovered via open file descriptors (`/proc/*/fd`) and ext4 journal recovery.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- **Single Folder Access on Google Drive:**\n  - Native Google Drive web sharing does not have an \"Upload without Edit/Delete\" role. \"Viewer\" *cannot* upload at all.\n  - The correct, secure implementation is:\n    1. **Scope: `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.file`**: The application has access *only* to files and folders it creates. It has zero visibility into personal drive files.\n    2. **Rclone `root_folder_id`**: Set to the Folder ID from the Drive URL (`drive.google.com/drive/folders/<FOLDER_ID>`). Rclone is restricted to that single folder and cannot traverse up.\n    3. **Upload command: `rclone copy --immutable`**: Guarantees no existing files are ever modified or deleted.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Google Drive Auth Listener:**\n  - `task-7010` is running in background, listening on `127.0.0.1:53682` waiting for OAuth callback with `drive.file` scope.\n- **Network & Speed Benchmark:**\n  - Direct Azure-to-Google bandwidth: 144 MB/s (1.15 Gbps), latency 1.9 ms.\n- **Active Web Services:**\n  - Cloudflare tunnel active on port 8085 serving `output_packaged/` and `azureuser_root/`.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps\n1. **Explain the 2-Part Single Folder Solution to Iraq Bhai:**\n   - **Part A (`drive.file` Scope):** Show the exact Google OAuth link with `scope=https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.file`. When he clicks it, Google's screen will explicitly state: *\"See, edit, create, and delete only the specific Google Drive files you use with this app\"*. It will NOT ask for full drive access.\n   - **Part B (`root_folder_id` Lock):** Ask Iraq Bhai to create a folder (e.g. `Azure_Backup`), copy its Folder ID from the URL (`drive.google.com/drive/folders/<FOLDER_ID>`), and provide it so we lock Rclone permanently into that folder only.\n2. **Execute OAuth Token Exchange:**\n   - Once Iraq Bhai approves the `drive.file` consent screen and pastes the redirect callback URL or `code=...`, complete the token exchange with `task-7010`.\n3. **Configure Rclone Remote:**\n   - Write `/home/azureuser/.config/rclone/rclone.conf` with:\n     ```ini\n     [gdrive]\n     type = drive\n     client_id = REDACTED_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.redacted\n     client_secret = [REDACTED_SECRET]\n     scope = drive.file\n     root_folder_id = <USER_FOLDER_ID>\n     token = <TOKEN_JSON>\n     ```\n4. **DO NOT START SYNCING:** Wait for Iraq Bhai's explicit instruction before executing any file copy or backup jobs.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Absolute Rule:** NO autonomous sync will start without Iraq Bhai's explicit command.\n- **Security Mandate:** NO full drive permissions. Access must be strictly restricted to `drive.file` and `root_folder_id`.\n- **Response Language & Style:** Pure Bengali script (বাংলা লিপি), address user as **\"ইরাক ভাইয়া\"**, single asterisks `*` only (NO `**`), line length max 48-50 chars, clamped dividers 30-32 chars (`«──────────────────────────────»`), full absolute file paths (`file:///...`).\n- **Zero mention of GitHub as local project store.** All projects and backups are local Azure VM and Google Cloud VM.\n</summary>\n\n# Subagents\nThe following subagents were spawned during this conversation (up to 20).\nView the conversation log to see the full conversation with the subagent and use send_message with the conversation_id to communicate with them.\n\n{\n  \"spec\":  {\n    \"typeName\":  \"ask_and_research\",\n    \"role\":  \"Ask & Research Specialist\",\n    \"initialPrompt\":  \"অনুগ্রহ করে আপনার অ্যাক্টিভেশন যাচাই করুন, বর্তমান ওয়ার্কস্পেস পাথ চেক করুন এবং 'Ask & Research' সাব-এজেন্ট হিসেবে আপনার মূল দায়িত্ব ও ক্ষমতা বাংলা লিপিতে সংক্ষিপ্তভাবে রিপোর্ট করুন।\",\n    \"inherit\":  true,\n    \"model\":  \"MODEL_PLACEHOLDER_M322\",\n    \"modelTier\":  \"MODEL_TIER_FLASH\"\n  },\n  \"result\":  {\n    \"conversationId\":  \"97a12c58-ac5f-42a8-a933-07336c81795c\",\n    \"logAbsoluteUri\":  \"file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/97a12c58-ac5f-42a8-a933-07336c81795c/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl\",\n    \"workspaceUris\":  [\n      \"file:///home/azureuser\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"spawnStepIndex\":  2747\n}\n\n# Running Background Tasks\nThe following background tasks were running at the time this checkpoint was created.\nUse the manage_task tool to interact with them (e.g. to kill them or check their status).\n\n{\n  \"taskId\":  \"47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/task-7010\",\n  \"toolName\":  \"run_command\",\n  \"toolSummary\":  \"rclone authorize drive.file\",\n  \"description\":  \"rclone authorize \\\"drive\\\" \\\"REDACTED_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.redacted\\\" \\\"[REDACTED_SECRET]\\\" --drive-scope=\\\"drive.file\\\" --auth-no-open-browser\",\n  \"startTime\":  \"2026-09-25T14:12:52.767472609Z\",\n  \"stepIndex\":  7010,\n  \"logUri\":  \"file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/.system_generated/tasks/task-7010.log\"\n}"}
